# Keep track and note of important build steps
Take notes of key steps and commands so other developers can setup their systems accordingly.

- take notes of build steps by developer platform (MacOS, Linux, Windows)
- take notes of key steps by target (iOS, Android, MacOS Desktop, Linux, Windows)
- Write all notes into the README.md file located within this repostory

# Keep track of key changes in CHANGELOG
When making changes such as adding new or changing key functionality (UI) wise or extending a function (adding a new feature):

- Check and update the CHANGELOG file located in the root of this repository 
- First check if the intended addition already exist within the last 10 lines
- General do not bump versions or create new versions records
- Add items to the latest version records
- Mark new lines as *proposed* 
- Make us of the following prefixes "Bugfix:", "Feature:", "Security:" and "Important:"
